1
00:00:00,309 --> 00:00:02,479
(Amy:)of you even going to Mars
are incredibly small,

2
00:00:02,477 --> 00:00:05,147
(Amy:)but it still hurts
that you would volunteer

3
00:00:05,147 --> 00:00:07,917
(Amy:)for something that would
take you away from me forever.

4
00:00:07,916 --> 00:00:10,246
(Sheldon:)So you're saying you
wouldn't leave me

5
00:00:10,252 --> 00:00:12,452
(Sheldon:)for the chance to be
one of the first humans

6
00:00:12,454 --> 00:00:14,024
(Sheldon:)to colonize
another planet?

7
00:00:14,022 --> 00:00:16,022
(Amy:)I would at least mention it

8
00:00:16,024 --> 00:00:17,854
(Amy:)before filling out
the application.

9
00:00:17,859 --> 00:00:21,199
(Sheldon:)Huh, that's exactly what
Leonard, Wolowitz, Koothrappali,

10
00:00:21,196 --> 00:00:22,426
(Sheldon:)Bernadette and
Penny said.

11
00:00:24,231 --> 00:00:25,731
(Amy:)And who says
you could even survive

12
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:27,564
(Amy:)an interplanetary
mission, anyway?

13
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:29,899
(Amy:)You could barely survive
a tiny turtle bite.

14
00:00:29,905 --> 00:00:31,905
(Sheldon:)First of all, this...

15
00:00:31,907 --> 00:00:34,607
(Sheldon:)has only made me stronger.

16
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,610
(Sheldon:)But beyond that, all I did

17
00:00:36,612 --> 00:00:38,212
(Sheldon:)was fill out an application.

18
00:00:38,213 --> 00:00:40,213
(Amy:)You know what?

19
00:00:40,215 --> 00:00:42,285
(Amy:)Go to Mars, Sheldon.

20
00:00:45,119 --> 00:00:47,719
(Sheldon:)Is there anything I can
do to cheer you up?

21
00:00:47,723 --> 00:00:49,153
(Amy:)No. Forget it.

22
00:00:50,458 --> 00:00:52,758
What if I play the Star Trek
theme on my nose?

23
00:00:52,761 --> 00:01:01,021
(Amy:)Please don't.
(humming the Star Trek theme)

